{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act23side_level_act23side_03_beg",
  "groupId": "act23side",
  "stageId": "act23side_03",
  "title": "树犹如此",
  "storyCode": "WB-3",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act23side/level_act23side_03_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4535ec8f0ca010ba05fb0d6ba53911d2b7ac9115d1ad725b78e3ff01a29305d8",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的武人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "让我们出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "该说的话刚才已经说过了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "将军有令，为了玉门安危，戒严期间，任何人不得擅自出城。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "请回吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的武人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你跟我讲玉门安危？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的武人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们守玉门城的时候，你小子还没摸过刀呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "非常时期，请大家以大局为重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的武人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大局为重？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的武人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那年一伙流寇潜入城中偷抢钱财，伤了好几个无辜百姓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的武人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "事发突然，不清楚具体情况，你们守军不敢妄动，是我们哥几个追了出去，整整三天，在沙漠里追出去几百里地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的武人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们背着一半只剩一口气的兄弟，最终把贼人逮回城里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的武人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "现在是我们的兄弟死在了城外，尸骨都没能收回来，你让我们在这里等着？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "荆前辈，我们都听过您的故事，也很敬重您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但左将军有令，城中正在缉拿要犯，没有他本人特许，任何人不得出入玉门。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的武人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好大的威风！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的武人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就叫左宣辽出来见我们！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放肆！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的武人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "坊主......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大老远就听到你们在这嚷嚷，这些当兵的兄弟也是奉了上头的命令，何必为难他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的武人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这口气，我们咽不下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们都是城里的老人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "参与过几次守城的战斗，顶着天灾护送过几次信使，这玉门城的安定，有你们一份辛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但平祟侯还在，宗师也还在，哪里轮得到你们靠资历摆谱？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "失落的武人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "坊主，你难道心里......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好汉不提当年勇，那点事，不拿出来说，也有人记得。记不得的，说了也没用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先回去，别闹事。有我在，死去的兄弟们少不了说法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "失落的武人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是我管教无方，给大家伙添麻烦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不怪孟前辈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那四位武行的兄弟......孟前辈节哀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们的家人，我会负责照顾，不劳平祟侯费心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但他们是死在为玉门送信的路上，我想替大伙问一句，平祟侯对这件事，到底有什么说法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "事分轻重缓急，等捉拿了城中刺客，平祟侯一定会出兵清剿流寇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好......“轻重缓急”，言之有理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只是要平祟侯的一句话，不管这句话是什么，我都带去回复弟兄们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等事了，还是欢迎大伙再来铸剑坊喝酒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雨霞姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们那边情况怎么样？牺牲者的家属，有没有找到？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "其实四个人中，有两人都是独自生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至于另外两人，家属恰好都不在家，我们冒昧闯了进去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有些奇怪，他们的家中一如往常......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也可能是家属正好外出不在......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "昨日信使队伍遇难的消息传回，已经过去了整整一天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谁？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "吓我一跳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "刚才突然觉得，好像有人在盯着我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这大街上来来往往这么多人，你还能注意到？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "回客栈再说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "林雨霞，留步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是这个人......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我和这人说几句话，你们等我一会儿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没想到肃政院的监察御史还记得我。上次见面应该已经是五年前了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那次见面的时机，令人难忘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但不太令人愉快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "公事公办，你我皆是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "林特使在这里，也是在调查玉门城中事变了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "御史有什么指教？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不。在下此时并非以官身介入。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是作为平祟侯旧部，作为大炎子民，捉拿祸乱百姓安生的奸徒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "太合御史这次不劝我置身事外，我反倒是有点意外了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "林特使有职责在身，在下没有理由劝阻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "请恕在下多事一问。林特使初到玉门，对城中情形还不算熟悉，你打算如何查案？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我当然有自己的手段，不劳太合御史操心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也相信林特使的手段，自然有过人之处。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "太合御史不妨把话说清楚一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还是刚才的话，公事公办，仅此而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在下只是来提醒林特使，敌暗我明，千万小心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "告辞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那个大块头，我在尚蜀见过......好像是肃政院的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你到底还认识多少大官？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不是认识，只是打过交道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有什么区别？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "区别在于，一些打交道的人，你并不想认识。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先回去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "薄暮。\n早春时节，日头下去得快，天气还是有些冷。\n老人往火炉里填了一把柴。\n这点火没法锻造，甚至不能用来取暖。但是在工坊所有设备都用源石点火的今天，老人还是固执地留下了这样一个无用的炉子。\n等炉火烧旺的工夫，他拿起扫帚，细细清扫起院落里昨夜积下的沙子，每一处石砖间的缝隙都不放过。\n老人当然知道，这会儿打扫干净，不一会儿又会落满一地的沙。\n但他还是不厌其烦地，一遍又一遍地扫着地，仿佛就为了看一眼工坊阶净台明的样子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这腿脚哟，回暖了，也还是冻得有些发疼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这个点准备关门了。不急的话，等明天再过来吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "姑娘是不是找错了地方，这里是工坊，不是医馆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "异族装扮的少女",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我在找......一个故事里的地方......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一个伤得这么重的人，不该在城里乱跑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "虽然不愿意这么讲，但眼下城中戒严，一个身受刀伤的人突然出现在家门口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我要是不把姑娘抓起来交给官府，那就是我有问题了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也不想多生事端，还是麻烦姑娘说明一下来历吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "异族装扮的少女",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......是不是叫孟铁衣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如今城里能直接叫出这个名字的年轻人，我总该有点印象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可我却不认得你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "异族装扮的少女",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "师父说过，在移动城市里，藏着一个工坊。工坊的主人，是一个本领高强的刀匠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "异族装扮的少女",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他会打造各种各样的武器和铠甲，也会做些有趣的小玩具送给城里的孩子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我一时都想不起来，还有谁会这么形容我这个老头子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "异族装扮的少女",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在工坊的院子里，种着一棵槐树。是你们一起从很远的地方移栽回来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老人不由得回首。\n院子的一角，一株槐树迎着晚风微微摆首。北地春迟，树枝上还没有长出新叶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "朔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "到了这里，这一仗才算真正结束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣辽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们也有不少死伤......但至少二十年，这帮贼寇再难成什么气候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "朔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "听说古人远征大胜，会在最远处的山岩上刻录自己的战功。今天这一仗，也值得我们效仿古人遗风了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣辽",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈哈，倒是不错，但这附近都是沙漠，放眼过去也没什么能写字的地方......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "朔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只有这边孤零零的一棵树，那不如就——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "负剑的女侠",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好什么好！你们没看见这棵树都快枯死了，还要折腾它？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "朔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你出个主意？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "负剑的女侠",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "移动城市千里奔行，漂泊不定，把战功刻在一个固定的所在又有什么意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "负剑的女侠",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们今天在此见到了这棵树，不如就把它带回去，种在玉门。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "负剑的女侠",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它在玉门城里扎根生长一日，我们今天的故事就能被铭记一日。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "朔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（抚掌）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "朔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好，好。这主意不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们是不是被太阳晒晕了头......此地离玉门城足足有一百里，你们是打算把这棵树扛回去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "朔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这有何妨，来的时候那么多粮食和水都吃完了，回去的时候多带一棵树又怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "朔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "左兄，铁衣兄弟，来搭把手。小心别挖断了树根。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你叫她师父......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "异族装扮的少女",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "师父在荒野上救了我和族人，教我们安家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你叫什么名字？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "异族装扮的少女",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "截云。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果我没看错，你是阿纳萨......却有一个这么风雅的名字？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "师父取的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "难怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“云动千里雨，截在此山晴。”她是希望你们从此不再漂泊无依吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "师父念得比你好，但她说的，也是这样的意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......哈哈，那是肯定的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "说起来，宗师的名字也是她取的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那个薄情寡义的人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这又是从何说起......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等，你身上这把剑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你偷了宗师的佩剑？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我要把这把剑，带到师父的坟头，祭拜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "风吹叶动，老槐树沙沙作响。\n炉子里的火熄灭了，天色更加暗沉。但老人没有动。\n少女看不清他的表情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她——死了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯。师父的病很严重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "师父最后的心愿，就是再看一眼这把剑，我必须给她个交代......\n你也要抢吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我当然不会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "玉门现在很危险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道，拿了这把剑，城里的军人都在抓我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，我是说，这座城接下来会很危险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这座城接下来会迎接一个考验。但在那之前，我至少应该，把你送出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的师父在等一个交代......我们这些人，都在等一个交代。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是，要怎么出城？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "来的时候没有想过。城门也已经封了，硬闯的话......我受了伤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "起了风。\n一些细沙扬到了老人的脸上，落入岁月的沟壑中。\n沾着早春暮间的湿气，柔软。\n老人用手捻了捻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我有办法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哟，您回来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "情况怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "跑腿的路人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "医馆没有医生也没有伙计，只见到一个穿官服的公子哥，问我去干什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那您怎么说......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "跑腿的路人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就按你说的，“昨夜里商店货架倒了，家里人被砸破了脑袋，送来医馆的时候匆忙没带钱，现在把医药费补上”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "跑腿的路人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那公子哥问完我这句话也就走了。不明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "跑腿的路人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喏，让我送的钱没送出去，还给你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您收下吧，一点辛苦费。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "跑腿的路人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真奇怪，玉门的旅游季钱这么好赚了吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "知道鲤先生手眼通天，可现在竟然都忽悠到晚辈身上了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那位公子哪能算什么晚辈，他可是司岁台的秉烛人，我哪来的胆子去骗他......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "帮他排除一个错误答案罢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "林先生这是......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "闲逛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "换作是在龙门的市民公园遇见您，我也就信了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鲤先生这边可有进展？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "说来奇怪，林先生托我的事情还没眉目，反倒是我要找的那个人有了点线索。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那也是好事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "林先生把事情交给我，自己也不见得放心，为什么不亲自出手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要我出手，就是直接去拂魏彦吾的面子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也正好在一旁看看，她是怎么办事的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不愧是林先生，事情到了这个节骨眼，还有余裕下一着试应手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "磨刀不误砍柴工。也是鲤先生值得信赖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鲤先生最终没能留在近卫局，魏彦吾还常常感慨来着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就别提了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "魏彦吾啊......从不放过任何一个能派上用场的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "话说回来，林先生还是下定决心要让雨霞姑娘接您的班了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这不该由我说了算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她要是想留下，龙门自然有她的安身之所，她要是想离开，龙门也不该是她的后顾之忧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "无论她选哪条路，我都想拜托鲤先生，能给她一些照应。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "能让林先生这么信任，是我的荣幸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雨霞姑娘那边，帮得上忙的，我会上心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我接着溜达，就不打扰鲤先生了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "槐天裴啊槐天裴，同样是父亲......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你来的路上，有没有留意到巡防营发布的全城通知？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "根据钦天监观测台的最新测算结果，为了躲避天灾，玉门城需要修改航向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "明天申时起，整座城市开始减速，大概酉时三刻左右，它的行进速度会降至最低，航线修正完毕后再重新加速。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那便是你的机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是，城市减速，城门的防守应该会更加严密才对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "孩子，进入玉门前，你有没有好好看过这座城市？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "千里大漠，人迹罕至，祸乱频生，但仍是大炎疆土。玉门打一开始，便是作为镇守北方的军事堡垒而设计。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "正因如此，有别于常规的移动城市，玉门在外墙处特别加造了“沙渠”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "正常来讲，沙渠绝不会成为人通行的道路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "人如果跳进沙渠，可能会被轮机绞碎，也可能会被翻滚的黄沙淹没而窒息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "明天酉时，玉门行进速度降至最低，也将是沙渠运转最慢的时候......或许还有一丝可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那也要试！我必须要出城。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是你的伤？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "之前已经在医馆处理过了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是，沙渠通常不会有太多防守，但现在情况特殊，全城戒严，不知道有没有什么变化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "来的路上，听说现在是这座城的将军亲自在城楼领兵布防。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "该见不该见，终归是要见一面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你要出去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "事不宜迟，我得去探查一下情况。而且要想从沙渠出城，也还有些准备工作要做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我出去的时候会在门口挂上暂停营业的牌子，你趁这段时间好好养伤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我到时候回来接你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雨霞姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们先去我房间，我马上就来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有什么发现？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙门暗桩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您走之后不久，里面出来了一些铁匠打扮的人，拉着货物往别的地方去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙门暗桩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我尝试跟踪，但对面显然也是行家，察觉到有人跟着，很快就把我甩开了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙门暗桩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我回过头再去查看仓库，里面东西已经被清得一干二净。虽然不知道这伙人在隐藏什么，但显然事有蹊跷......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙门暗桩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小姐直觉没错，那个铸剑坊多半有问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "恐怕现在已经打草惊蛇，而我们还没有找到关键证据。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "城头的乌云好像一天比一天厚，风里的沙子也越来越多了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "事态紧急。既然有所怀疑，那就试探试探。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙门暗桩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你去趟军营，替我取个东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
